    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Ordering and paying at the café",
     "texto": [
      "To order politely, add «alstublieft» (please, formal): «Een kopje thee, alstublieft» (A cup of tea, please). To ask for the bill: «De rekening, alstublieft». For the payment method, there are two options: «contant» (cash) or «pinnen» (pay by debit card, a very important verb in the Netherlands). «Wilt u nog iets?» means «Would you like anything else?»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
